{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>美國財政部長斯科特·貝森特表示，美國總統特朗普與中國國家主席習近平在深圳舉行會晤期間，就人工智能在軍事領域的應用達成重要共識，</strong>雙方一致認為，涉及人工智能的軍事決策必須始終保留人為參與，不應允許人工智能系統在重大軍事行動中完全自主作出決定。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587328.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T18:44:25.184209+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T18:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T18:37:34.823964+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T18:37:34.823964+00:00","content_hash":"02529ca048ecdfdd97928aff7ad11727092eb524ac394a6d5fa33b03550f4597","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}